<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Order List — Mastex Catalog</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css">
<style>
  :root{ --accent:#e8590c; --accent-2:#ff8c42; --accent-soft:#fff1e8; }
</style>
<script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark">MX</div>
      <div class="brand-text">
        <b>Order List</b>
        <span>For Mastex</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="/" class="back-link" style="margin-left:auto;">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
      All vendors
    </a>
    <a class="icon-btn" href="/favorites" title="All favourites">
      <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
      <span class="cart-badge" id="favoritesBadge">0</span>
    </a>
    <button class="icon-btn" id="themeToggle" title="Toggle theme">
      <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>Your order list</h1>
  <p>Items you've added across any vendor page, combined into one list. Adjust quantities below, then export it as a CSV or copy it as plain text to send to Mastex.</p>
</div>

<div class="banner">
  <div class="banner-inner">
    <span>🛒</span>
    <span>This cart is real (saved in your browser's local storage), but "sending to Mastex" just exports a file or copies text — there's no order-submission backend yet.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap" id="wrap"></div>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<script src="/js/cart.js"></script>
<script src="/js/favorites-badge.js"></script>
<script src="/js/cart-page.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
